OL,3,GNEWSACyclist avoiding 'wrong-way'
OL,4,Adriver breaks 11 ribs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cyclist fractured 11 ribs after
OL,7,Ffalling from his bike while swerving to
OL,8,Favoid a motorist travelling in the
OL,9,Fwrong direction towards him in a car
OL,10,Fpark, police have said.
OL,12,FCheshire Police said a 58-year-old man
OL,13,Fwas riding his bike at Pickering's
OL,14,FPasture in Widnes at about 10:30 BST on
OL,15,F16 September when a vehicle drove the
OL,16,Fwrong way through the site.
OL,18,FIts driver did not stop and left the
OL,19,Fscene, said a force spokesperson.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
